  "observations": [
    "The argument progresses from a bounded pilot decision through opportunity selection, release accountability, delivery gates and conditional investment.",
    "All five pages share calibrated Georgia titles, Arial supporting roles, restrained orange emphasis, consistent decision bands and one inherited native frame.",
    "Seventeen source-bound Remix icons clarify rationale, workflow stages, evidence gates and release criteria. They remain canonical SVG objects in PowerPoint.",
    "The generated images cover the 1920 by 960 content region. PowerPoint adds the common header, footer and page number through one shared layout.",
    "The capacity chart remains linked to its workbook. Tables, text, arrows, icons and decision controls remain separate native objects.",
    "Every page retains its image-generation request, asset selection, semantic map, OpenCV evidence, compiled scene, render and visual comparison."
  ],
  "editability_limits": [
    "Native chart values and labels are linked to their embedded workbook. Separate formula text and scenario table cells do not recalculate automatically.",
    "The two feedback routes are editable PowerPoint freeforms. Automatic connector reattachment after moving their related objects is not claimed.",
    "Verification uses the recorded macOS LibreOffice and installed fonts. Pixel identity across other Office renderers is not claimed."
